---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Community Baptist Church South Sudan — a growing Christian church family in Aweil, rooted in God's Word, committed to sharing Christ, making disciples, serving communities and reaching South Sudan and beyond."
    />

    <meta
      name="keywords"
      content="Community Baptist Church South Sudan, CBC South Sudan, Baptist Church Aweil, church Aweil, South Sudan church, Christian church Aweil"
    />

    <meta
      property="og:title"
      content="Community Baptist Church South Sudan"
    />

    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Growing in faith, serving in love and reaching communities for the glory of Christ."
    />

    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />

    <title>Community Baptist Church South Sudan</title>

    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/png"
      href="/images/community-baptist-church-south-sudan-final-favicon.png"
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --primary: #0b4f8a;
        --primary-dark: #07385f;
        --secondary: #f39c12;
        --dark: #102a43;
        --text: #435466;
        --muted: #6b7b8c;
        --light: #f5f8fb;
        --white: #ffffff;
        --border: #e5ebf1;
        --soft-blue: #edf5fb;
        --shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.1);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background: var(--white);
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1180px, 92%);
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 100px 0;
        scroll-margin-top: 105px;
      }

      .anchor-target {
        scroll-margin-top: 105px;
      }

      .section-title {
        max-width: 820px;
        margin: 0 auto 55px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .section-title span {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2.5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .section-title h2 {
        margin-bottom: 17px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }

      .section-title p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.04rem;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 13px 23px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-weight: 800;
        transition: 0.25s ease;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: var(--secondary);
        color: white;
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        background: #d88708;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .btn-blue {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: white;
      }

      .btn-blue:hover {
        background: var(--primary-dark);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      /* HERO */

      .hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 700px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #071d2d;
      }

      .hero-slide {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        opacity: 0;
        transition:
          opacity 0.9s ease,
          visibility 0.9s ease;
      }

      .hero-slide.active {
        visibility: visible;
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .hero-slide::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: -30px;
        background-image: var(--hero-bg);
        background-position: center;
        background-size: cover;
        filter: blur(15px);
        transform: scale(1.08);
        opacity: 0.42;
      }

      .hero-slide::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background:
          linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.94) 0%,
            rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.78) 42%,
            rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.25) 100%
          );
      }

      .hero-image {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 1;
        top: 3%;
        right: 5%;
        width: 53%;
        height: 94%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center;
        border-radius: 5px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      }

      .hero-slide.portrait .hero-image {
        right: 5%;
        width: 48%;
        height: 94%;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 3;
        min-height: 700px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        width: 49%;
        padding: 70px 0;
        color: white;
      }

      .hero-copy span {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 17px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2.2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .hero-copy h1 {
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        color: white;
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.04;
        letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      }

      .hero-copy p {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-bottom: 31px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.91);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .hero-scripture {
        max-width: 520px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        padding-left: 18px;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--secondary);
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .hero-scripture strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 5px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-style: normal;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }

      .hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .btn-outline {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 13px 23px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
        border-radius: 5px;
        color: white;
        font-weight: 800;
        transition: 0.25s ease;
      }

      .btn-outline:hover {
        background: white;
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .hero-controls {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 5;
        bottom: 30px;
        left: 4%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
      }

      .hero-arrow {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        color: white;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .hero-arrow:hover {
        border-color: var(--secondary);
        background: var(--secondary);
      }

      .hero-dots {
        display: flex;
        gap: 7px;
        margin-left: 8px;
      }

      .hero-dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .hero-dot.active {
        background: var(--secondary);
        transform: scale(1.35);
      }

      /* STATS */

      .welcome {
        background: white;
      }

      .stats {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: -55px;
      }

      .stat {
        padding: 31px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: white;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .stat strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 2.45rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .stat span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      /* WHO WE ARE */

      .who-we-are {
        background: white;
      }

      .who-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
        gap: 70px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .who-image {
        position: relative;
      }

      .who-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 500px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 9px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .who-image-card {
        position: absolute;
        right: -20px;
        bottom: -25px;
        width: 260px;
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--primary);
        color: white;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .who-image-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }

      .who-image-card span {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .who-content .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .who-content h2 {
        margin-bottom: 21px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.1rem);
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .who-content p {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .who-highlight {
        margin: 27px 0;
        padding: 19px 20px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
        background: var(--light);
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 1.03rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      /* VISION / MISSION */

      .vision-mission {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .vm-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 25px;
      }

      .vm-card {
        padding: 42px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .vm-card.mission {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: white;
      }

      .vm-label {
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .vm-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 1.75rem;
      }

      .vm-card.mission h3 {
        color: white;
      }

      .vm-card p {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .vm-scripture {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 38px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 1.12rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .vm-scripture strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      /* STORY */

      .story {
        position: relative;
        background: white;
      }

      .story-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 70px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .story-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 530px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .story-content .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .story-content h2 {
        margin-bottom: 21px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.1rem);
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .story-content p {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .story-highlight {
        margin: 27px 0;
        padding: 17px 0 17px 20px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 1.03rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .scripture-box {
        margin: 27px 0;
        padding: 22px 24px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: var(--light);
        box-shadow: 0 7px 25px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.06);
      }

      .scripture-box p {
        margin: 0 0 5px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .scripture-box strong {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      /* REACH */

      .reach {
        background: var(--primary-dark);
        color: white;
      }

      .reach .section-title h2,
      .reach .section-title p {
        color: white;
      }

      .reach-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .reach-card {
        padding: 32px 25px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      }

      .reach-icon {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      .reach-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: white;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .reach-card p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        font-size: 0.93rem;
      }

      .reach-scripture {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 45px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .reach-scripture strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 7px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      /* VIDEO */

      .video-section {
        background: white;
      }

      .church-video {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #071d2d;
        box-shadow: 0 22px 55px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
      }

      .church-video video {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        max-height: 650px;
        background: #000;
      }

      .video-caption {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 25px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      /* MINISTRIES */

      .ministries {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .ministry-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 22px;
      }

      .ministry-card {
        padding: 34px 28px;
        border-top: 3px solid transparent;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: 0 7px 25px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.07);
        transition: 0.25s ease;
      }

      .ministry-card:hover {
        border-top-color: var(--secondary);
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .ministry-icon {
        width: 55px;
        height: 55px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--soft-blue);
        font-size: 1.45rem;
      }

      .ministry-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 9px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .ministry-card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      /* CHURCH PLANTING */

      .planting {
        background: white;
      }

      .planting-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
        gap: 60px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .planting-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 500px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .planting-content .eyebrow,
      .education-content .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .planting-content h2,
      .education-content h2 {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .planting-content p,
      .education-content p {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .planting-stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 15px;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }

      .planting-stat {
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .planting-stat strong {
        display: block;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 2rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .planting-stat span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      /* DISCIPLESHIP */

      .discipleship {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .discipleship-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .discipleship-card {
        padding: 30px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: 0 7px 25px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.06);
      }

      .discipleship-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .discipleship-card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }

      .discipleship-quote {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 42px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .discipleship-quote strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 7px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      /* PASTOR */

      .pastor {
        background: white;
      }

      .pastor-grid {
        max-width: 1000px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 390px 1fr;
        gap: 60px;
        align-items: center;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .pastor-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 500px;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center top;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .pastor-content .eyebrow {
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .pastor-content h2 {
        margin: 7px 0 4px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 2.55rem;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .pastor-role {
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .pastor-content p {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .qualification {
        margin-top: 24px;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .qualification strong {
        display: block;
        color: var(--dark);
      }

      .pastor-scripture {
        margin-top: 24px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .pastor-scripture strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 5px;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      /* FAMILY */

      .family {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: white;
      }

      .family .section-title span {
        color: var(--secondary);
      }

      .family .section-title h2,
      .family .section-title p {
        color: white;
      }

      .family-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .family-card {
        padding: 37px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      }

      .family-card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 3px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .family-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: white;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }

      .family-card p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
      }

      .family-scripture {
        max-width: 750px;
        margin: 40px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .family-scripture strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 6px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      /* CHILDREN */

      .children {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .children-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 55px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .children-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 460px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .children-content h2 {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .children-content p {
        margin-bottom: 17px;
      }

      .children-scripture {
        margin: 24px 0;
        padding: 20px 22px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: 0 7px 25px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.06);
      }

      .children-scripture p {
        margin: 0 0 5px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .children-scripture strong {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      /* EDUCATION */

      .education {
        background: white;
      }

      .education-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 60px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .education-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 470px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .education-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 13px;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }

      .education-item {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .education-item span:first-child {
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .education-item strong {
        color: var(--dark);
      }

      .education-quote {
        margin-top: 25px;
        padding: 20px;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
        background: var(--light);
        color: var(--dark);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      /* PROFILE GALLERY */

      .profile-gallery {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .profile-photo-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 22px;
      }

      .profile-photo-card {
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: 0 7px 25px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.07);
      }

      .profile-photo-card img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 245px;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .profile-photo-card div {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .profile-photo-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: var(--dark);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .profile-photo-card p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }

      /* SCHEDULE */

      .schedule {
        background: white;
      }

      .schedule-table {
        max-width: 950px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .schedule-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr 1fr;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .schedule-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      .schedule-row > div {
        padding: 17px 20px;
      }

      .schedule-head {
        background: var(--primary);
        color: white;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .schedule-row:not(.schedule-head):nth-child(even) {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .schedule-row:not(.schedule-head) > div:first-child {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .schedule-note {
        max-width: 750px;
        margin: 30px auto 0;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      /* GALLERY */

      .gallery {
        background: var(--light);
      }

      .gallery-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .gallery-item {
        height: 225px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: #ddd;
      }

      .gallery-item img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
      }

      .gallery-item:hover img {
        transform: scale(1.06);
      }

      /* CONTACT */

      .contact {
        background:
          linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            var(--primary-dark),
            var(--primary)
          );
        color: white;
      }

      .contact-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 70px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .contact .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 9px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .contact h2 {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        color: white;
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .contact p {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      }

      .contact-scripture {
        margin: 25px 0;
        padding-left: 18px;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--secondary);
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.93);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .contact-scripture strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 5px;
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      .contact-details {
        display: grid;
        gap: 17px;
      }

      .contact-detail {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .contact-detail > div:first-child {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
      }

      .contact-detail strong {
        display: block;
        color: white;
      }

      .contact-detail span {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      }

      .contact-link {
        color: var(--secondary);
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .contact-link:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      /* FOOTER */

      footer {
        padding: 55px 0 25px;
        background: #061a29;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      }

      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 50px;
        padding-bottom: 35px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      }

      .footer-brand {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .footer-brand img {
        width: 67px;
        height: 67px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      footer h3 {
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        color: white;
      }

      footer p {
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .footer-links {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .footer-links a:hover {
        color: var(--secondary);
      }

      .footer-scripture {
        margin-top: 20px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .copyright {
        padding-top: 22px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.83rem;
      }

      /* RESPONSIVE */

      @media (max-width: 1050px) {
        .hero-copy {
          width: 53%;
        }

        .hero-image {
          width: 50%;
        }

        .reach-grid,
        .discipleship-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .ministry-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .gallery-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .section {
          padding: 75px 0;
          scroll-margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .hero {
          min-height: 760px;
        }

        .hero-content {
          min-height: 760px;
          align-items: flex-end;
        }

        .hero-slide::after {
          background:
            linear-gradient(
              180deg,
              rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.12) 0%,
              rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.5) 40%,
              rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.95) 70%,
              rgba(4, 24, 42, 0.98) 100%
            );
        }

        .hero-image,
        .hero-slide.portrait .hero-image {
          top: 3%;
          left: 12%;
          right: auto;
          width: 76%;
          height: 54%;
          object-fit: contain;
          box-shadow: none;
        }

        .hero-copy {
          width: 100%;
          padding: 35px 0 90px;
        }

        .hero-copy h1 {
          font-size: 2.55rem;
        }

        .hero-copy p {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .hero-scripture {
          font-size: 0.88rem;
        }

        .stats {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
          margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .who-grid,
        .vm-grid,
        .story-grid,
        .planting-grid,
        .pastor-grid,
        .children-grid,
        .education-grid,
        .contact-grid,
        .family-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .who-grid,
        .story-grid,
        .planting-grid,
        .education-grid {
          gap: 45px;
        }

        .who-image-card {
          right: 15px;
        }

        .story-image img,
        .planting-image img,
        .education-image img {
          height: 390px;
        }

        .pastor-image {
          max-width: 430px;
          margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .pastor-image img {
          height: 450px;
        }

        .children-image img {
          height: 360px;
        }

        .reach-grid,
        .discipleship-grid,
        .ministry-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .profile-photo-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .gallery-grid {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .gallery-item {
          height: 190px;
        }

        .schedule-row {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          padding: 9px 0;
        }

        .schedule-head {
          display: none;
        }

        .schedule-row > div {
          padding: 5px 18px;
        }

        .schedule-row:not(.schedule-head) > div:first-child {
          padding-top: 12px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 30px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero {
          min-height: 730px;
        }

        .hero-content {
          min-height: 730px;
        }

        .hero-image,
        .hero-slide.portrait .hero-image {
          height: 50%;
          top: 2%;
        }

        .hero-copy {
          padding-bottom: 85px;
        }

        .hero-copy h1 {
          font-size: 2.18rem;
        }

        .stats {
          gap: 10px;
        }

        .stat {
          padding: 22px 10px;
        }

        .stat strong {
          font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .vm-card {
          padding: 30px 24px;
        }

        .planting-stats {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .gallery-grid {
          gap: 8px;
        }

        .gallery-item {
          height: 160px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <!-- NEW REUSABLE HEADER -->
    <Header />


    <!-- HERO -->

    <section class="hero" id="home">

      {heroSlides.map((slide, index) => (
        <div
          class={`hero-slide ${index === 0 ? "active" : ""} ${
            [3, 8, 10, 11, 12, 15, 16].includes(index)
              ? "portrait"
              : ""
          }`}
          style={`--hero-bg: url('${slide.image}')`}
          data-slide={index}
        >

          <img
            class="hero-image"
            src={slide.image}
            alt={slide.title}
            loading="eager"
          />

          <div class="container hero-content">

            <div class="hero-copy">

              <span>Community Baptist Church South Sudan</span>

              <h1>{slide.title}</h1>

              <p>{slide.text}</p>

              {index === 0 && (
                <div class="hero-scripture">
                  “Ye are the light of the world.”
                  <strong>Matthew 5:14</strong>
                </div>
              )}

              <div class="hero-buttons">

                <a href="#our-story" class="btn btn-primary">
                  Discover Our Story
                </a>

                <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline">
                  Worship With Us
                </a>

              </div>

            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      ))}

      <div class="hero-controls">

        <button
          class="hero-arrow"
          id="prevSlide"
          aria-label="Previous slide"
        >
          ←
        </button>

        <button
          class="hero-arrow"
          id="nextSlide"
          aria-label="Next slide"
        >
          →
        </button>

        <div class="hero-dots">

          {heroSlides.map((_, index) => (
            <button
              class={`hero-dot ${index === 0 ? "active" : ""}`}
              data-dot={index}
              aria-label={`Go to slide ${index + 1}`}
            ></button>
          ))}

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- STATS -->

    <section class="welcome">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="stats">

          <div class="stat">
            <strong>2014</strong>
            <span>Church Began</span>
          </div>

          <div class="stat">
            <strong>500</strong>
            <span>Church Members</span>
          </div>

          <div class="stat">
            <strong>26</strong>
            <span>Sister Churches</span>
          </div>

          <div class="stat">
            <strong>100</strong>
            <span>Churches — Our Vision</span>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- WHO WE ARE -->

    <section class="who-we-are section" id="who-we-are">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

          <span>Who We Are</span>

          <h2>A People Brought Together by God</h2>

          <p>
            We are a community of believers seeking to love God, serve one
            another and make Christ known.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="who-grid">

          <div class="who-image">

            <img
              src="/images/cbc-profile-photo-02.jpg"
              alt="Community Baptist Church South Sudan community gathering"
              loading="lazy"
            />

            <div class="who-image-card">

              <strong>One Family</strong>

              <span>
                United by faith, strengthened by God's Word and called to
                serve.
              </span>

            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="who-content">

            <div class="eyebrow">Our Identity</div>

            <h2>Rooted in Christ. Sent to Serve.</h2>

            <p>
              Community Baptist Church South Sudan is a collective of people
              brought together by God, sharing a desire to love and serve in
              His name.
            </p>

            <p>
              We are grateful for God's abundant blessings and look ahead
              with faith, trusting Him to guide the path before us.
            </p>

            <p>
              The Bible stands at the centre of our life together. We believe
              that God's Word is foundational to both individual and church
              growth, shaping what we believe, how we live and how we serve.
            </p>

            <div class="who-highlight">
              We do not exist simply to gather within our walls. We exist to
              know Christ, grow in Christ and carry the hope of Christ to
              others.
            </div>

            <p>
              Empowered by the Holy Spirit, we seek to embrace the work God
              has entrusted to His people and to engage those in our
              communities who have yet to know Jesus as Lord and Saviour.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- VISION AND MISSION -->

    <section class="vision-mission section" id="vision-mission">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

          <span>Our Calling</span>

          <h2>Vision & Mission</h2>

          <p>
            Everything we do flows from our desire to see the truth of Jesus
            Christ transform lives and communities.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="vm-grid">

          <div class="vm-card">

            <div class="vm-label">Our Vision</div>

            <h3>Transforming Our Community</h3>

            <p>
              Our vision is to transform our community by sharing the truth
              of Jesus Christ.
            </p>

          </div>

          <div class="vm-card mission">

            <div class="vm-label">Our Mission</div>

            <h3>Sharing Christ Beyond Our Walls</h3>

            <p>
              As a people transformed by the Holy Spirit, our mission is to
              share Christ in our neighborhoods, surrounding communities,
              and out to the whole world.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="vm-scripture">

          “But ye shall receive power, after that the Holy Ghost is come
          upon you: and ye shall be witnesses unto me...”

          <strong>Acts 1:8</strong>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR STORY / JOURNEY -->

    <section class="story section" id="our-story">

      <span id="our-journey" class="anchor-target"></span>

      <div class="container">

        <div class="story-grid">

          <div class="story-image">

            <img
              src="/images/cbc-photo-01.jpg"
              alt="Community Baptist Church South Sudan"
              loading="lazy"
            />

          </div>

          <div class="story-content">

            <div class="eyebrow">Our Journey</div>

            <h2>From a Home Fellowship to a Growing Church Family</h2>

            <p>
              On <strong>23 November 2014</strong>, Community Baptist Church
              South Sudan began as a home fellowship in Ayaung village,
              Aweil, Northern Bahr el Ghazal State.
            </p>

            <p>
              What began as a gathering of believers has, by God's grace,
              grown into a church family of approximately
              <strong>500 members</strong>.
            </p>

            <div class="story-highlight">
              Our journey is more than a story of numbers. It is a testimony
              of God's faithfulness and of ordinary people responding to His
              call to love, serve, witness and make disciples.
            </div>

